WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:15.625
A road(?) ....................

2
00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:20.995
Gilgamish ...................

3
00:00:20.995 --> 00:00:25.344
in the plain ..................

4
00:00:25.344 --> 00:00:29.845
his hair growing thickly like the corn.

5
00:00:29.845 --> 00:00:34.685
He came forth ...

6
00:00:34.685 --> 00:00:39.240
into his presence.

7
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.070
They met in the wide park of the land.

8
00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:45.680
Enkidu held fast the door

9
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:50.350
with his foot,

10
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:54.250
and permitted not Gilgamish to enter.

11
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.830
They grappled with each other

12
00:00:56.830 --> 00:01:00.070
goring like an ox.

13
00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:04.640
The threshold they destroyed.

14
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:10.040
The wall they demolished.

15
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:14.480
Gilgamish and Enkidu

16
00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.560
grappled with each other,

17
00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.080
goring like an ox.

18
00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.350
The threshold they destroyed.

19
00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:30.460
The wall they demolished.

20
00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.930
Gilgamish bowed

21
00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:37.960
to the ground at his feet

22
00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:42.080
and his javelin reposed.

23
00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:43.670
He turned back his breast.

24
00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.960
After he had turned back his breast,

25
00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:52.520
Enkidu unto that one

26
00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:58.700
spoke, even unto Gilgamish.

27
00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:05.620
“Even as one did thy mother

28
00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:10.370
bear thee,

29
00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:14.240
she the wild cow of the cattle stalls,

30
00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.680
Ninsunna,

31
00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:21.700
whose head she exalted more than a husband.

32
00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:28.370
Royal power over the people

33
00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:33.150
Enlil has decreed for thee.”